From eed04dfe4788fbc16043842358fff52ebb84dce4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mike Kinney <mike.kinney@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 13 Nov 2026 21:11:12 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] fix(ui): preserve document when opening a project fails

Stage disk and byte project loads in a fresh world before retiring the
current document. Preserve window preferences on successful replacement
and name the attempted disk file in refusals.

Co-Authored-By: Codex <noreply@openai.com>

Fixes #1613
